# Keep the Docker build context small and free of local artefacts.
# NOTE: .env files are intentionally NOT excluded yet — see AUDIT.md D9.

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.cache

**/*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Local reports, test output and design originals (not needed in the image)
AUDIT.md
CHANGELOG.md
TEST_REPORT.md
test-results
client/design-originals

# Backups and dumps must never enter the build context
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
orbit-backups
avatar-backup*.json